.TH PERVIUS-INSPECT 1 "2026-11-18" "Pervius" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pervius\-inspect \- validate and summarize a VPN server catalogue
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pervius\-inspect
.RB { \-\-zip
.IR FILE " | "
.B \-\-url
.IR URL }
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates a server catalogue ZIP with the same strict rules as the desktop
application and prints a JSON summary. It does not touch NetworkManager.
.TP
.BI \-\-zip " FILE"
Read a local ZIP file.
.TP
.BI \-\-url " URL"
Download the ZIP over HTTPS.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pervius (1)
